EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
    Pyrite                   0.8 0.0
    Chalcopyrite(alpha)      -2.0 0.0
    Bornite(alpha)           -1.0 0.0
    Magnetite                0.6 0.0
    Chalcocite(alpha)        1.0 0.0
    Au(element)              0.0 0.0
    Cu(element)              0.0 0.0

KINETICS 1-10
Hematite_PK
    -formula  Fe2O3  1
    -m      5e-07
    -m0     5e-07
    -parms  0.0 1000.0 10.0 0.67 -9.39 66.2 1.0 -14.6 66.2 -30.0 0.0 0.0
    -tol    1e-08
    -step_divide 10
    -runge_kutta 3
    -bad_step_max 500

TRANSPORT
    -cells                 10
    -shifts                2
    -time_step             10000.0
    -flow_direction        diffusion_only
    -boundary_conditions   constant closed
    -lengths               0.001
    -dispersivities        1e-06
    -diffusion_coefficient 1e-09
    -punch_cells           1-10
    -punch_frequency       1

END

